MeeGo-like look (pro1x-maemo-leste patches/meego): while the root window
has _HILDON_MEEGO_LOOK (hildon-desktop sets it), the status area as the
N9's status bar: one row, black, across the screen (hildon-desktop places
it so), the signal and the other icons on the left, the battery and the
clock on the right.

